    "display_name": "Nexi Base",
    "publisher": "Nexi",
    "description": "Nexi Base — the layer every organization starts from: human-reviewed skills (summarize, extract, classify, answer from sources, compare, draft, translate, meeting notes to actions, mail triage, the analysis skills, web-source curation), the everyday agents (General, Analyst, Writer, Reviewer, Governance, the analysis planner, the web-source curator), the Flows they make whole (document review, data extraction, weekly digest, member onboarding, admin governance, mail triage, web source, the three BI automations), the orchestration patterns, the platform tool allow-list, model roles, sandbox profiles, approvals and retention policy, and the dashboard templates. Generic, vendor-free: no instances, no credentials, no tenant data.",
    "license": "Apache-2.0",
    "created_at": "2026-09-17T00:00:00Z",
    "homepage": "https://github.com/NexiFlow-ai/nexi-skills"
